add('Six slices from one cake',K,'MAYA, DAN, LEO','Maya cuts the small cake into six equal wedges with an adult-handled knife. Use an explicit short serving-time ellipsis. Dan steadies the board, not the blade; Leo counts divisions from a safe distance.','One whole small round cake on board; six table plates empty.','Cake divided into six wedges; none removed yet; knife under Maya’s control.',('LEO','Six equal slices.'),('DAN','No four-or-forty problem today.'),('MAYA','Just six people sharing one cake.'))
add('The first two plates',T,'NINA, DAN, LEO','Nina transfers two wedges onto Dan’s and Leo’s empty plates using a clean server. Dan stays seated; Leo moves his fork clear. The board is held by Nina, not duplicated on table.','Six wedges on board; all six plates empty; knife left safely in kitchen.','Two wedges served: Dan and Leo; four wedges remain on Nina’s board.',('NINA','One for Dan, one for Leo.'),('DAN','A very successful delivery.'),('LEO','This time we saw it arrive.'))
add('Two more, not a refill',T,'NINA, MAYA, ELLA','Nina serves one wedge each to Ella and Maya in their fixed places, keeping the board level. Maya thanks her; Ella checks the remaining pair without touching it.','Dan and Leo each have one; four wedges on board; other four plates empty.','Four served total; two wedges remain for Nina and Max.',('ELLA','Two left on the board.'),('MAYA','One for Nina, one for Max.'),('NINA','Exactly. No one has to guess.'))
add('The last pair completes the table',T,'NINA, MAX, ELLA','Nina serves the final two wedges onto her own plate and Max’s. Ella sets the single strawberry beside Max’s slice with clean tongs brought from kitchen.','Four people served; two wedges on board; strawberry on clean dish beside Ella.','Six plates with one wedge each; board empty; one strawberry on Max’s plate only.',('MAX','My slice has an assistant.'),('ELLA','The emergency strawberry.'),('NINA','Six slices. Everyone has one.'))
add('Sharp tools stay in the kitchen',K,'MAYA, DAN','Maya returns the server and empty cake board to the island, away from the dining table. Dan puts the adult-used knife safely in the designated washing area, blade facing away.','Six slices served; kitchen knife parked safely at island; empty board/server arriving back.','No sharp knife or box at children’s table; island holds empty board and used serving tools.',('DAN','The cake is with the family. The sharp tools stay here.'),('MAYA','That is a good final check.'))
add('One honest box on the list',K,'DAN, MAYA, NINA','Dan adds the cake receipt checkmark only now, then writes a small new line: ask and check. Maya and Nina read it beside him; phone remains with Nina.','Cake served safely; checklist still has blank delivery task; no new decorations.','Cake task checked; ask-and-check reminder added; checklist folded in right pocket.',('DAN','I wanted a perfect party.'),('NINA','You made room for a real one.'),('MAYA','We found the cake together.'))
add('Six seats, one celebration',T,'DAN, MAYA, NINA, LEO, ELLA, MAX','All six settle into their original fixed seats. Hold the six servings before anyone takes a bite. No extra guest, seventh chair, candles or cake on the center board appears.','One wedge per plate; strawberry only with Max; empty board already in kitchen.','Six seated in canon positions; desserts untouched; calm celebration ready.',('DAN','To this very helpful team.'),('MAYA','And our kind neighbor.'),('NINA','And checking the whole address.'))
add('A short hello from Grandpa Ed',T,'NINA, DAN, MAX','Nina answers a brief incoming audio call from her father Ed on her phone, holding it in her right hand without speaker video. Everyone remains at the table; no new face appears.','Six seated; desserts untouched; Nina’s phone receives one call.','Audio call active; Ed voice-only; phone held by Nina, not Dan.',('ED','Did the family party start yet?'),('NINA','Almost, Dad. Our cake visited the neighbor first.'),('MAX','It came back with a story.'),off='ED')
add('An address beats a lucky guess',T,'NINA, DAN, LEO','Ed’s audio voice answers while Nina smiles. Dan and Leo share a warm look. Nina ends the call after saying goodbye; no continuing offscreen voice follows.','Ed audio call active; six desserts still untouched.','Call ended; phone placed screen-down beside Nina’s setting, away from food.',('ED','A clear address is better than a lucky guess.'),('DAN','We have been collecting evidence for that.'),('NINA','Thanks, Dad. Talk soon.'),off='ED')
add('The first bite is finally simple',T,'DAN, MAYA, NINA, LEO, ELLA, MAX','Each takes a small first bite from their own slice. Use relaxed reaction coverage and a brief eating-time ellipsis; cake does not return whole between angles.','Six complete wedges at fixed seats; call ended; only Max has strawberry.','Each slice has a small bite missing; no serving remains in kitchen.',('MAX','Sweet. Not sour.'),('ELLA','And no flowers in it.'),('MAYA','Just a very welcome cake.'))
add('More than the decoration',T,'DAN, MAYA, NINA','Dan looks around the table rather than at the door decorations. Maya and Nina answer together in separate turns, with the same respect and warmth they have shown throughout.','Everyone eating from existing servings; plates never refill.','Dan’s shoulders relaxed; family’s shared effort acknowledged.',('DAN','The ribbons were not the best part.'),('MAYA','What was?'),('DAN','Everyone staying with the problem. And with me.'))
add('A different kind of perfect',T,'LEO, ELLA, DAN','Leo gestures lightly with his empty hand, fork resting on plate. Ella smiles at the family’s varied earlier mix-ups; Dan accepts the affectionate callback.','Six original seats; slices partly eaten; no extra food.','Warm agreement without a new errand or humiliation.',('LEO','You do not have to guess alone.'),('ELLA','Even when your checklist looks impressive.'),('DAN','Especially then.'))
add('The little assistant retires',T,'MAX, NINA, ELLA','Max eats his one strawberry with his fork after Nina checks the small bite. The empty berry space remains on his plate; no second strawberry appears.','One washed strawberry on Max’s plate; slice partly eaten.','Max’s single strawberry eaten; all other plates unchanged apart from normal eating.',('MAX','Emergency strawberry, thank you for your service.'),('NINA','A very small hero.'),('ELLA','With excellent timing.'))
add('One last useful question',T,'DAN, MAYA, NINA, LEO, ELLA, MAX','Dan glances at the empty center of the table, then asks rather than announcing a new plan. All six share an easy laugh; nobody gets up or starts another story.','Cake servings partly eaten; box and board remain in kitchen; fixed seats.','Family continues celebration with no unresolved delivery or new production task.',('DAN','Would anyone like to stay right here for a while?'),('MAYA','Yes.'),('NINA','No directions required.'))
add('The right place all along',T,'DAN, MAYA, NINA, LEO, ELLA, MAX','Warm wide hold of the six original family members at the canonical table. Fade the editable end-card into the final two seconds inside this shot, keeping the current food states.','Six at table with partly eaten single servings; Max’s strawberry gone; no phone call active.','Story closes exactly20:00; family together; no whole cake, seventh guest or practice segment.',('MAX','The party found the right house.'),('DAN','It had the right people all along.'))
